# Relative humidity of a gas. Minted because the OpenCyphal standard set has no
# humidity sample type -- relative humidity is dimensionless, so it falls
# outside uavcan.si.sample.* entirely (ADR-0005 d2: mint only for a real gap).
#
# Dimensionless and unscaled, for the reason ADR-0005 rev 1 gave for joule over
# watt-hour: a scaled unit on the wire is a display convention, and display is
# the gateway's concern. 0.658 here is the 65.8 %RH of M01 spec 6.1.
#
# Which sensor produced it is carried by the subject, not by a field: M01
# publishes its primary (SHT45) and its two secondary sources (BME688, SCD41) on
# separate subjects, because only the primary is admissible for VPD (spec 4).
uavcan.time.SynchronizedTimestamp.1.0 timestamp
float32 ratio  # 0.0 = dry, 1.0 = saturated
@extent 16 * 8
